<title>BRAZIL: ADVISORY--Brazil markets shut Fri for mayoral vote.</title>
<headline>ADVISORY--Brazil markets shut Fri for mayoral vote.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian financial markets are closed today for second-round nationwide mayoral elections.</p>
<p>Markets are scheduled to reopen Monday.</p>
<p>-- James Craig, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 248 5413</p>
</text>
